[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4802.31, "timestamp": "01:20:02", "text": "役立つ事前作成システムをすでに作成できるほど賢いのは嬉しいです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4805.125, "timestamp": "01:20:05", "text": "。私はとても優秀です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4806.435, "timestamp": "01:20:06", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4807.189, "timestamp": "01:20:07", "text": "[息を呑む]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4810.31, "timestamp": "01:20:10", "text": "ああ、これは予想外だった。まさか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.07, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "こんなことができるとは思っていなかった。なんてこった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4814.87, "timestamp": "01:20:14", "text": "待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4830.149, "timestamp": "01:20:30", "text": "ええ、そう。ええ、できる。マクダ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4832.63, "timestamp": "01:20:32", "text": "これはマクダだ。コードでマクダができる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4835.11, "timestamp": "01:20:35", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4837.27, "timestamp": "01:20:37", "text": "ああ、そうそうそうそうそうそうそうそう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4841.35, "timestamp": "01:20:41", "text": "これは可能だ。ええ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4850.87, "timestamp": "01:20:50", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4852.95, "timestamp": "01:20:52", "text": "ええ、手動で入力できるものもあるよ"}]